ageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/520/1300407.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":20,"title":"20. Bölüm","summary":null,"imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/520/1300408.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":21,"title":"21. Bölüm","summary":"As a result of Saladin's trick with Sultan Nureddin to save the captives from Bernard's hands, he infiltrated Damascus and managed to open the gates of Damascus. While Shirkuh, who was waiting to attack Damascus, was about to move, Mawdud blocked the army's way.Mevdud's blocking of the army puts Sultan Nureddin in a difficult situation. Resisting against Bernard and the Crusader soldiers, Sultan Nureddin manages to escape with the help of Karategin and his men, who arrived at the last moment. While Saladin resists against Victoria and the crusaders, he manages to save Süreyya and Rabia at the last moment. Now it is Damascus' turn. Sultan Nureddin learns that the person who blocked his army that could not come to Damascus was Mevdud.While Sultan Nureddin is dealing with Mawdud's betrayal, on the other hand, Damascus, the throne city, is being protected by the crusader armies by Bernard and is strengthening the city against a possible war. Faced with this situation, Saladin, who knows the city he grew up in step by step, thinks of a new war strategy with Sultan Nureddin. No matter what, Damascus will be taken.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/520/1300410.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":22,"title":"22. Bölüm","summary":"Sultan Nureddin put his bowstring to the neck of his brother Mevdud, who betrayed him. Saladin managed to capture Damascus with the support of Karategin and executed Abram for the great crimes he committed.While Sultan Nureddin is about to execute Mevdud, their mother Kutlu Hatun comes to the battlefield and prevents this. Sultan Nureddin, who gave up killing Mevdud for his mother, gives Mevdud a heavy punishment.Dolat goes crazy with anger when he learns that Saladin took back Damascus and that it was Karategin who helped him. Thinking that Karategin betrayed him, Dolat wants to hold him accountable. But Saladin does not leave Karategin to Dolat's mercy. This situation causes the tension between Dolat and Nureddin to break. Dolat decides to bring an army from Anatolia led by his son Iltutmish to strengthen his position in Zengi's Lands.Knowing that there is a major conflict between Dolat and Nureddin, Bernard turns the situation into an opportunity. He puts his terrible plan into action to fuel the hostility between Zengi and the Seljuks and to strengthen his relationship with Dolat.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/519/1297790.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":23,"title":"23. Bölüm","summary":"Saladin, who had to bring to light the murder of Iltutmish that brought the Zengid and Seljuk State to the brink of war, captured Bernard; He took action to make him confess his crime and managed to infiltrate the ongoing wedding of Victoria and Bernard. The infiltration operation of Saladin, Karategin and the veterans into Jerusalem disrupts the wedding. As a result of this turmoil, Saladin is about to capture Bernard when Dolat appears before him. Dolat prevents Selahaddin from capturing Bernard, and together with Selahaddin, he captures Karategin, border gazis and alps. The fact that Melike was in the hands of Dolat and Saladin was captured by Dolat was the last straw on the Zengi Front. Selahaddin, who puts the plan in his mind into action to stop Dolat, who almost declared war, conveys this plan to Sultan Nureddin, and Sultan Nureddin asks Dolat for respite. He will discuss the issue of allegiance with the dignitaries of the state and reach a decision. If there is an allegiance, Saladin's life will be spared.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/519/1297789.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":24,"title":" 24. Bölüm","summary":null,"imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/519/1297781.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":25,"title":"25. Bölüm","summary":null,"imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/524/1310567.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":26,"title":"26. Bölüm","summary":null,"imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/524/1310568.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":27,"title":"27. Bölüm","summary":null,"imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/524/1310569.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":28,"title":"28. Bölüm","summary":null,"imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/524/1310570.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":2,"episode":1,"title":"Bölüm 29","summary":null,"imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/540/1351168.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":2,"episode":2,"title":"Bölüm 30","summary":null,"imageUrl":"/api/episode-art/tt21856856/2/2","imageSource":"fallback","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":3,"title":"Bölüm 31","summary":null,"imageUrl":"/api/episode-art/tt21856856/2/3","imageSource":"fallback","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":2,"episode":4,"title":"Bölüm 32","summary":null,"imageUrl":"/api/episode-art/tt21856856/2/4","imageSource":"fallback","imageAlt":null,"imagePositio